# Garment Employee Productivity Analysis

### Machine Learning Mini Project | Regression

## 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing and predicting garment employee productivity using Machine Learning techniques.

It explores various factors influencing employee productivity and develops regression models to predict actual productivity. The project aims to provide insights that can support better workforce management and production planning.

## 🎯 Project Objectives

- Analyze garment employee productivity patterns.
- Identify factors influencing actual productivity.
- Perform data cleaning and preprocessing.
- Explore relationships between different features.
- Build and evaluate multiple regression models.
- Compare model performance using evaluation metrics.
- Select the best-performing model for productivity prediction.

## 📂 Dataset Information

**Dataset Name:** Productivity Prediction of Garment Employees

- Total Records: 1,197
- Original Features: 15
- Target Variable: `actual_productivity`
- Problem Type: Supervised Machine Learning – Regression

**Dataset Source:** [GitHub Repository](https://github.com/sathyabamasrsep13/Garment-Employee-Productivity-Analysis)

